{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":499523,"name":"","username":"David.J","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/david.j/{size}/121241_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T23:57:04.785Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499523-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499523-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499523-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499523-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn macOS, Grok Bot 0.58.0, bots screen view disappeared. Can’t preview the screen anymore, as well as click on it to access the bot screen view.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI could probably prompt, but then it would spend usage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499523-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499523-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen a bot → top right corner → option not showing anymore.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499523-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499523-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499523-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499523-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.58.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499523-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499523-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T23:57:09.865Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":12,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":61.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172836,"topic_slug":"bots-screen-view-disappeared","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138401,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/bots-screen-view-disappeared/172836/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":499557,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-24T00:44:37.252Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/david.j\"\u003e@David.J\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe screen view moved rather than went away. In 0.58.0, the separate computer button in the top right was folded into the Bot’s name at the top center of the chat. To get back to it:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the Bot’s chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick the Bot’s name at the top center of the window. A panel opens on the right showing the Bot’s settings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick the back arrow (“Back to details”) at the top left of that panel.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe live screen preview is at the top of the panel. Click it to open the full computer view.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can also toggle that panel with \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCmd+Shift+I\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-24T00:44:37.252Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":21.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172836,"topic_slug":"bots-screen-view-disappeared","display_username":"Kevin Neilson","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":105146,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/bots-screen-view-disappeared/172836/6","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":499564,"name":"","username":"David.J","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/david.j/{size}/121241_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-24T01:12:23.652Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/kevinn\"\u003e@kevinn\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI just found out actually and I was about to update that post, haha.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you!\u003cbr\u003e\n(we can close the thread)\u003c/p\u003e",